Honeykrisp: ignore VS inputs past maxVertexInputAttributes.

DXVK's D3D9 fixed-function VS reads 18 attributes and uses binding 16.
Slots past 16 overflowed root attrib arrays, prolog keys and vb[].

--- a/src/asahi/vulkan/hk_cmd_buffer.h
